me><surname>Lunshof</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Chadwick</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Vorhaus</surname><given-names>DB</given-names></name><name><surname>Church</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><article-title>From genetic privacy to open consent.</article-title><source>Nat Rev Genet</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>406</fpage><lpage>411</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nrg2360</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18379574</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B16"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><collab>Genetic Alliance. Press release 8 September 2008</collab><article-title>Private access and genetic alliance announce strategic partnership to accelerate medical research while protecting privacy.</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.geneticalliance.org/ws_display.asp?filter=strategic.partnership.press.release">http://www.geneticalliance.org/ws_display.asp?filter=strategic.partnership.press.release</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B17"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><collab>Department of Health and Human Services, Health Information Technology</collab><article-title>Personalized Health Care Workgroup</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://healthit.hhs.gov/portal/server.pt?open=512&#x00026;objID=1201&#x00026;&#x00026;PageID=15528&#x00026;mode=2&#x00026;in_hi_userid=10732&#x00026;cached=true">http://healthit.hhs.gov/portal/server.pt?open=512&#x00026;objID=1201&#x00026;&#x00026;PageID=15528&#x00026;mode=2&#x00026;in_hi_userid=10732&#x00026;cached=true</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B18"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><article-title>Google Health</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://www.google.com/health">https://www.google.com/health</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>